# ApplyFlow – Smart Job Application Tracker

A modern and responsive job application tracking dashboard built with React and Vite. ApplyFlow helps job seekers organize applications, manage interviews, and understand their job search progress through analytics.

## Live Demo

**[Visit ApplyFlow](https://apply-flow-zeta.vercel.app/)**

## GitHub Repository

**[View Source Code](https://github.com/vaishnaviwaikar18/ApplyFlow)**

## Features

- **Dashboard:** View application statistics and job search progress.
- **Application Management:** Add, edit, delete, search, and filter job applications.
- **Interview Management:** Schedule interviews, add meeting details, and update interview statuses.
- **Analytics Dashboard:** Visualize application activity, status distribution, and performance metrics.
- **Local Storage:** Keep application and interview records saved in the browser across refreshes.
- **Responsive Interface:** Clean dashboard layout designed for different screen sizes.

